                </span>
                <h3 className="font-heading font-bold text-xl text-[#F0F4EC] mb-2 group-hover:text-[#6DB33F] transition-colors">
                  Guest Service Assessments
                </h3>
                <p className="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#F0F4EC]/75 leading-relaxed">
                  Independent mystery visits, reservation and arrival checks, service quality, billing accuracy, and corrective-action reporting.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div className="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-[#6DB33F] font-semibold">
