                </h3>
                <p className="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#F0F4EC]/75 leading-relaxed">
                  Evaluate receiving, storage, allergen communication, sanitation, recipe consistency, and food quality.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div className="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-[#6DB33F] font-semibold">
                <span>Sanitation & Quality</span>
                <iconify-icon icon="solar:shield-check-linear" width="16" height="16"></iconify-icon>
              </div>
            </div>

            {/* Service 4: GROW */}
            <div className="bento-card rounded-3xl p-7 bg-[#0C1208]/80 border border-white/10 hover:border-[#6DB33F]/50 backdrop-blur-md transition-all flex flex-col justify-between group shadow-lg">
              <div>
                <span className="inline-block text-[11px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#6DB33F] bg-[#6DB33F]/15 px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-4">
