                </span>
                <h3 className="font-heading font-bold text-xl text-[#F0F4EC] mb-2 group-hover:text-[#6DB33F] transition-colors">
                  SHM Academy
                </h3>
                <p className="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#F0F4EC]/75 leading-relaxed">
                  Frontline service, café and beverage skills, complaint recovery, supervisor coaching, and train-the-trainer programs.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div className="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-[#6DB33F] font-semibold">
                <span>Staff Capability</span>
                <iconify-icon icon="solar:arrow-right-linear" width="16" height="16"></iconify-icon>
              </div>
            </div>

            {/* Service 6: CONNECT */}
            <div className="bento-card rounded-3xl p-7 bg-[#0C1208]/80 border border-white/10 hover:border-[#6DB33F]/50 backdrop-blur-md transition-all flex flex-col justify-between group shadow-lg">
              <div>
                <span className="inline-block text-[11px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#6DB33F] bg-[#6DB33F]/15 px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-4">
                  Connect
                </span>
                <h3 className="font-heading font-bold text-xl text-[#F0F4EC] mb-2 group-hover:text-[#6DB33F] transition-colors">
                  Digital Revenue & Reputation
                </h3>
                <p className="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#F0F4EC]/75 leading-relaxed">
                  Google Business Profile, local SEO, review management, direct inquiries, and responsible guest engagement.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div className="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-[#6DB33F] font-semibold">
                <span>Reputation & SEO</span>
                <iconify-icon icon="solar:arrow-right-linear" width="16" height="16"></iconify-icon>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          {/* 5-Step Improvement Cycle */}
          <div className="mt-16 pt-12 border-t border-white/10">
            <div className="text-center mb-8">
              <span className="text-xs uppercase font-extrabold tracking-wider text-[#6DB33F]">
                The Continuous Methodology
              </span>
              <h3 className="font-heading font-extrabold text-2xl text-[#F0F4EC] mt-1">
                How SHM Works
              </h3>
            </div>
            <div className="methodology-grid grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-4">
              {[
                { step: "01", name: "Discover", desc: "Initial owner alignment & baseline expectations" },
                { step: "02", name: "Assess", desc: "Mystery guest visit & operational checks" },
                { step: "03", name: "Diagnose", desc: "1,000-point scoring & root cause analysis" },
                { step: "04", name: "Improve", desc: "Targeted staff coaching & menu engineering" },
                { step: "05", name: "Reassess", desc: "Verify measurable commercial gains" },
              ].map((item, idx) => (
                <div
                  key={idx}
                  className="methodology-step p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-center hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors"
                >
                  <div className="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-[#4A8C2A] text-[#0C1208] font-extrabold text-xs mx-auto mb-3 flex items-center justify-center">
                    {item.step}
                  </div>
                  <h4 className="font-heading font-bold text-sm text-[#F0F4EC] mb-1">{item.name}</h4>
                  <p className="text-[11px] text-[#F0F4EC]/65 leading-snug">{item.desc}</p>
                </div>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      {/* 
        ========================================================================
        SECTION 4 - WHO WE SERVE & WHY CHOOSE US
        Slant: .slant-both
        Z-index Overlap: -mt-[4vw]
        Background: Light surface cream gradient from-[#F0F4EC] to-[#E2EBD6]
        Content: Independent Restaurants, Cafes & Bakeries, Bars & Lounges, Multi-Outlet Groups, Boutique Hotels, Pre-Opening Businesses
        Hover: Interactive Floating Preview on client segments (Substance Lab interaction)
        ========================================================================
      */}
      <section
        id="clients"
        className="relative z-20 py-24 lg:py-36 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#F0F4EC] to-[#E2EBD6] text-[#0C1208] slant-both -mt-[4vw]"
      >
        <div className="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-8 pb-8">
          <div className="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
            <span className="inline-block uppercase tracking-wider text-xs font-extrabold text-[#4A8C2A] bg-[#4A8C2A]/10 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full mb-3">
              Client Sectors
            </span>
            <h2
              className="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-[#0C1208] leading-tight"
              style={{ letterSpacing: "-0.04em" }}
            >
              Who We Serve
            </h2>
            <p className="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-[#0C1208]/75">
              A practical performance partner for independent food-service businesses.
            </p>
          </div>

          {/* Interactive Row-Based Capabilities / Client List */}
          <div className="max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-20 divide-y divide-[#0C1208]/15 border-y border-[#0C1208]/15">
            {[
              {
                title: "Independent Restaurants",
                desc: "Service standards, kitchen coordination, menu performance and repeat business.",
                preview: "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/5ca1f1c6-3233-49f9-a741-9ff10131fcb5_1600w.jpg",
              },
              {
                title: "Cafés & Bakeries",
                desc: "Speed, product consistency, customer care and takeaway operations.",
                preview: "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1770664945615-52203ab54c88?w=800&q=80",
              },
              {
                title: "Bars & Lounges",
                desc: "Beverage service, stock accountability and guest experience.",
                preview: "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1622122123829-e0490a288d04?w=800&q=80",
              },
              {
                title: "Multi-Outlet Groups",
                desc: "Consistent SOPs, outlet comparisons and management reporting.",
                preview: "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/3ac110ad-4dc4-4e37-ad7b-367feb87ed83_1600w.jpg",
              },
              {
                title: "Boutique Hotels & Resorts",
                desc: "Tailored hospitality assessments as a secondary service offering.",
                preview: "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/b5413203-6577-42c0-954e-3811b69415b0_3840w.png",
              },
              {
                title: "Pre-Opening Businesses",
                desc: "Concept readiness, staff training, operating standards and launch support.",
                preview: "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/43b80983-9fa2-4c0d-9cbc-19fcb75ccbea_1600w.png",
              },
            ].map((client, idx) => (
              <div
                key={idx}
                onMouseEnter={() => {
                  setCursorImg(client.preview);
                  setCursorActive(true);
                }}
                onMouseLeave={() => setCursorActive(false)}
                className="py-6 px-4 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-3 group hover:bg-[#4A8C2A]/10 transition-colors cursor-pointer rounded-xl"
              >
                <div className="flex items-center gap-4">
                  <span className="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-[#4A8C2A]">0{idx + 1}</span>
                  <h3 className="font-heading font-extrabold text-xl text-[#0C1208] group-hover:translate-x-2 transition-transform">
                    {client.title}
                  </h3>
                </div>
                <p className="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#0C1208]/70 max-w-md">{client.desc}</p>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>

          {/* Why Choose an SHM Assessment */}
          <div className="mt-16 pt-12 border-t border-[#0C1208]/10">
            <div className="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12">
              <span className="text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#4A8C2A]">
                The Value Proposition
              </span>
              <h3 className="font-heading font-extrabold text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#0C1208] mt-1">
                Why Choose an SHM Assessment?
              </h3>
              <p className="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#0C1208]/70 mt-2">
                Understand your operation, strengthen guest satisfaction, and uncover opportunities for improved commercial performance.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div className="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
              {[
                { title: "Understand Your Business", text: "Discover what guests actually experience at every touchpoint." },
                { title: "Improve Guest Satisfaction", text: "Identify service gaps and build stronger hospitality habits." },
                { title: "Build Team Confidence", text: "Turn observations into practical coaching and SOPs." },
                { title: "Improve Operations", text: "Reduce inconsistencies in service, kitchen, and inventory routines." },
                { title: "Strengthen Commerciality", text: "Review menu margins, sales opportunities, and avoidable costs." },
                { title: "Track Progress", text: "Use baseline KPIs and reassessment to verify improvements." },
              ].map((item, idx) => (
                <div
                  key={idx}
                  className="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white/80 border border-[#0C1208]/10 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow"
                >
                  <div className="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-[#4A8C2A]/15 text-[#4A8C2A] flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
                    <iconify-icon icon="solar:shield-check-linear" width="18" height="18"></iconify-icon>
                  </div>
                  <h4 className="font-heading font-bold text-base text-[#0C1208] mb-1">{item.title}</h4>
                  <p className="text-xs text-[#0C1208]/70 leading-relaxed">{item.text}</p>
                </div>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      {/* 
        ========================================================================
        SECTION 5 - SHM ASSESSMENT STANDARDS & ACADEMY
        Slant: .slant-top with dark ink gradient
        Z-index Overlap: -mt-[4vw]
        Content: Tabbed 1,000-Point Standards (Departments, Performance Criteria, Emotional Rating) with GSAP smooth tab switching
        ========================================================================
      */}
      <section
        id="standards"
        className="relative z-30 pt-28 pb-32 bg-[#0C1208] text-[#F0F4EC] slant-top -mt-[4vw]"
      >
        <div className="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-8">
          <div className="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12">
            <span className="inline-block uppercase tracking-wider text-xs font-extrabold text-[#6DB33F] bg-[#6DB33F]/10 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full mb-3">
              Proprietary Framework
            </span>
            <h2
              className="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-[#F0F4EC] leading-tight"
              style={{ letterSpacing: "-0.04em" }}
            >
              SHM Assessment Standards
            </h2>
            <p className="mt-4 text-base text-[#F0F4EC]/75 leading-relaxed">
              A proposed original 1,000-point SHM framework with service quality and emotional impact feedback. Subject to pilot testing and validation.
            </p>

            {/* Interactive Tab Switcher with Smooth State Handling */}
            <div className="inline-flex p-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/10 border border-white/10 mt-8 gap-1 backdrop-blur-md shadow-lg">
              <button
                type="button"
                onClick={() => handleTabChange("departments")}
                className={`px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full text-xs font-bold transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer ${
                  activeTab === "departments"
                    ? "bg-[#4A8C2A] text-white shadow-[0_4px_16px_rgba(74,140,42,0.4)] scale-105"
                    : "text-white/70 hover:text-white"
                }`}
              >
                Departments
              </button>
              <button
                type="button"
                onClick={() => handleTabChange("performance")}
                className={`px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full text-xs font-bold transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer ${
                  activeTab === "performance"
                    ? "bg-[#4A8C2A] text-white shadow-[0_4px_16px_rgba(74,140,42,0.4)] scale-105"
                    : "text-white/70 hover:text-white"
                }`}
              >
                Performance Criteria
              </button>
              <button
                type="button"
                onClick={() => handleTabChange("emotions")}
                className={`px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full text-xs font-bold transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer ${
                  activeTab === "emotions"
                    ? "bg-[#4A8C2A] text-white shadow-[0_4px_16px_rgba(74,140,42,0.4)] scale-105"
                    : "text-white/70 hover:text-white"
                }`}
              >
                Emotional Rating
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>

          {/* Smooth animated tab content container */}
          <div ref={tabsContainerRef} className="tab-content-enter">
            {/* Tab 1: Departments */}
            {activeTab === "departments" && (
              <div className="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
                {[
                  { tag: "GUEST WELCOME", text: "Reservations, greeting, seating and first impressions." },
                  { tag: "DINING SERVICE", text: "Menu knowledge, attentiveness, order accuracy and farewell." },
                  { tag: "KITCHEN & FOOD SAFETY", text: "Food hygiene, handling, preparation and culinary consistency." },
                  { tag: "CAFÉ & BEVERAGE", text: "Drink quality, presentation and guest engagement." },
                  { tag: "CLEANLINESS", text: "Dining area, washrooms, equipment and sanitation." },
                  { tag: "COST & INVENTORY", text: "Purchasing, stock controls, waste, cash and profitability." },
                  { tag: "DELIVERY & TAKEAWAY", text: "Order accuracy, packaging, dispatch and service recovery." },
                  { tag: "PEOPLE & LEADERSHIP", text: "Training, shift management, coaching and staffing continuity." },
                  { tag: "DIGITAL & SUSTAINABILITY", text: "Reputation, guest communication and responsible operations." },
                ].map((item, idx) => (
                  <div key={idx} className="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 hover:border-[#6DB33F]/40 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 duration-200">
                    <span className="inline-block text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#6DB33F] bg-[#6DB33F]/15 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md mb-2">
                      {item.tag}
                    </span>
                    <p className="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#F0F4EC]/85 mt-1 leading-relaxed">{item.text}</p>
                  </div>
                ))}
              </div>
            )}

            {/* Tab 2: Performance Criteria */}
            {activeTab === "performance" && (
              <div className="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5">
                {[
                  { tag: "SERVICE", text: "Warmth, accuracy, menu knowledge and complaint handling." },
                  { tag: "PRODUCT", text: "Food, beverage, presentation, atmosphere and consistency." },
                  { tag: "EMOTIONAL INTELLIGENCE", text: "Empathy, personalization and guest recognition." },
                  { tag: "CLEANLINESS", text: "Sanitation, safe food handling and facility care." },
                  { tag: "EFFICIENCY", text: "Order flow, kitchen coordination and timely service." },
                  { tag: "FOOD QUALITY", text: "Freshness, temperature, recipes and presentation." },
                  { tag: "SALES OPPORTUNITY", text: "Helpful recommendations, repeat visits and margin awareness." },
                  { tag: "SUSTAINABILITY", text: "Waste reduction and responsible sourcing." },
                ].map((item, idx) => (
                  <div key={idx} className="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 hover:border-[#6DB33F]/40 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 duration-200">
                    <span className="inline-block text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#6DB33F] bg-[#6DB33F]/15 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md mb-2">
                      {item.tag}
                    </span>
                    <p className="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#F0F4EC]/85 mt-1 leading-relaxed">{item.text}</p>
                  </div>
                ))}
              </div>
            )}

            {/* Tab 3: Emotional Rating */}
            {activeTab === "emotions" && (
              <div className="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-5">
                {[
                  { tag: "VERY DISSATISFIED", text: "Neglected, frustrated or overlooked." },
                  { tag: "DISSATISFIED", text: "Disappointed or disconnected." },
                  { tag: "COMFORTABLE", text: "Respected, understood and comfortable." },
                  { tag: "POSITIVELY ENGAGED", text: "Appreciated, delighted and valued." },
                  { tag: "MEMORABLE EXPERIENCE", text: "Recognized, special and genuinely cared for." },
                ].map((item, idx) => (
                  <div key={idx} className="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 hover:border-[#6DB33F]/40 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 duration-200 text-center">
                    <span className="inline-block text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#6DB33F] bg-[#6DB33F]/15 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md mb-2">
                      {item.tag}
                    </span>
                    <p className="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#F0F4EC]/85 mt-1 leading-relaxed">{item.text}</p>
                  </div>
                ))}
              </div>
            )}
          </div>

          {/* Proposed Scoring Breakdown (1,000 Points) */}
          <div className="mt-20 pt-16 border-t border-white/10">
            <div className="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10">
              <span className="text-xs uppercase font-extrabold tracking-wider text-[#6DB33F]">
                Scoring Weight Distribution
              </span>
              <h3 className="font-heading font-extrabold text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#F0F4EC] mt-1">
                Our Proposed Scoring Framework
              </h3>
              <p className="text-xs text-[#F0F4EC]/65 mt-1">
                Original SHM planning weights — not LQA criteria or an existing certification.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div className="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-4">
              {[
                { pts: "250", label: "Guest Service & Emotional Experience" },
                { pts: "150", label: "Operations & SOP Compliance" },
                { pts: "100", label: "Product & Facility Quality" },
                { pts: "150", label: "Revenue & Sales Performance" },
                { pts: "150", label: "Cost & Profit Controls" },
                { pts: "100", label: "People & Leadership" },
                { pts: "60", label: "Digital & Reputation" },
                { pts: "40", label: "Sustainability, Safety & Local Value" },
                { pts: "1,000", label: "Total Proposed Points", highlight: true },
              ].map((box, idx) => (
                <div
                  key={idx}
                  className={`p-5 rounded-2xl border text-center transition-transform hover:-translate-y-1 ${
                    box.highlight
                      ? "bg-[#4A8C2A]/20 border-[#4A8C2A] col-span-2 sm:col-span-1 shadow-[0_0_24px_rgba(74,140,42,0.25)]"
                      : "bg-white/5 border-white/10"
                  }`}
                >
                  <div className="font-heading font-extrabold text-3xl text-[#6DB33F]">{box.pts}</div>
                  <div className="text-xs text-[#F0F4EC]/75 mt-1 font-medium">{box.label}</div>
                </div>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>

          {/* SHM Academy Section (From HTML) */}
          <div id="academy" className="mt-24 pt-16 border-t border-white/10">
            <div className="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12">
              <span className="inline-block uppercase tracking-wider text-xs font-extrabold text-[#6DB33F] bg-[#6DB33F]/10 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full mb-3">
                Workforce Development
              </span>
              <h3 className="font-heading font-extrabold text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-[#F0F4EC]">
                SHM Academy
              </h3>
              <p className="text-sm text-[#F0F4EC]/75 mt-2">
                Building service confidence, operating discipline, and stronger leadership through practical hospitality training.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div className="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
              {[
                { title: "Service Foundations", desc: "Guest welcome, reservations, table service and farewell." },
                { title: "Guest Recovery", desc: "Listening, empathy, complaint ownership and follow-up." },
                { title: "Food & Beverage Skills", desc: "Menu knowledge, café service, quality and thoughtful recommendations." },
                { title: "Kitchen Coordination", desc: "Food safety awareness, service timing and teamwork." },
                { title: "Restaurant Profitability", desc: "Recipe costing, menu engineering, inventory and waste." },
                { title: "Leadership & Coaching", desc: "Supervisory standards, training and performance conversations." },
              ].map((course, idx) => (
                <div key={idx} className="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 hover:border-white/20 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1">
                  <h4 className="font-heading font-bold text-lg text-[#F0F4EC] mb-2">{course.title}</h4>
                  <p className="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#F0F4EC]/70 leading-relaxed">{course.desc}</p>
                </div>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      {/* 
        ========================================================================
        SECTION 6 - START YOUR IMPROVEMENT JOURNEY (QUOTE & CONTACT)
        - Substance Lab Parallax Footer Headings: -0.3 negative speed multiplier
        - Exact Form fields from SHM HTML: Business Name, Business Type, Contact Email, What would you like to improve?
        ========================================================================
      */}
      <section id="contact" className="relative py-28 lg:py-36 overflow-hidden">
        {/* Full-width background image with deep ink gradient overlays */}
        <div className="absolute inset-0 -z-10">
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558864255-eced94afc9ec?w=3840&q=80"
            alt="Hospitality excellence backdrop"
            className="w-full h-full object-cover object-center"
          />
          <div className="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#0C1208] via-[#0C1208]/90 to-[#0C1208]" />
        </div>

        {/* Substance Lab Style Large Cropped Parallax Wordmark */}
        <div className="parallax-wordmark pointer-events-none select-none text-center overflow-hidden opacity-25 mb-4">
          <span className="font-heading font-extrabold text-[12vw] sm:text-[14vw] leading-none text-outline-stroke whitespace-nowrap block">
            HOSPITALITY
          </span>
        </div>

        <div className="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
          <div className="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12">
            <span className="inline-block uppercase tracking-wider text-xs font-extrabold text-[#6DB33F] bg-[#6DB33F]/10 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full mb-3">
              Get Started
            </span>
            <h2
              className="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-[#F0F4EC] leading-tight mb-4"
              style={{ letterSpacing: "-0.04em" }}
            >
              Start Your Improvement Journey
            </h2>
            <p className="text-sm sm:text-base text-[#F0F4EC]/80">
              Request a consultation. This is a prototype form: it does not transmit or store your details.
            </p>
          </div>

          {/* Form Card */}
          <div className="bg-[#0C1208]/85 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-3xl border border-white/15 p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-2xl">
            <form
              onSubmit={(e) => {
                e.preventDefault();
                alert(
                  "Prototype only: no request has been sent. Please connect this form to a secure service before publishing."
                );
              }}
              className="space-y-6"
            >
              <div className="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                {/* Business Name */}
                <div>
                  <label className="block text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#F0F4EC]/80 mb-2">
                    Business Name
                  </label>
                  <input
                    type="text"
                    required
                    placeholder="Restaurant or café name"
                    className="w-full px-4 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/15 text-[#F0F4EC] placeholder-white/30 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#4A8C2A] transition-all"
                  />
                </div>

                {/* Business Type */}
                <div>
                  <label className="block text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#F0F4EC]/80 mb-2">
                    Business Type
                  </label>
                  <select
                    required
                    defaultValue=""
                    className="w-full px-4 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-[#0C1208] border border-white/15 text-[#F0F4EC] focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#4A8C2A] transition-all"
                  >
                    <option value="" disabled className="text-white/40">
                      Select
                    </option>
                    <option value="Restaurant">Restaurant</option>
                    <option value="Cafe / Bakery">Café / Bakery</option>
                    <option value="Bar / Lounge">Bar / Lounge</option>
                    <option value="Multi-outlet">Multi-outlet</option>
                    <option value="Hotel / Resort">Hotel / Resort</option>
                  </select>
                </div>
              </div>

              {/* Contact Email */}
              <div>
                <label className="block text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#F0F4EC]/80 mb-2">
                  Contact Email
                </label>
                <input
                  type="email"
                  required
                  placeholder="you@example.com"
                  className="w-full px-4 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/15 text-[#F0F4EC] placeholder-white/30 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#4A8C2A] transition-all"
                />
              </div>

              {/* What would you like to improve? */}
              <div>
                <label className="block text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#F0F4EC]/80 mb-2">
                  What would you like to improve?
                </label>
                <textarea
                  rows={4}
                  placeholder="Service, training, cost control, guest experience..."
                  className="w-full px-4 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/15 text-[#F0F4EC] placeholder-white/30 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#4A8C2A] transition-all resize-none"
                ></textarea>
              </div>

              {/* Submit Button */}
              <button
                type="submit"
                className="w-full btn-primary py-4 rounded-xl text-sm font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center justify-center gap-2 cursor-pointer shadow-xl"
              >
                <span>Request Consultation (Demo)</span>
                <iconify-icon icon="solar:arrow-right-linear" width="18" height="18"></iconify-icon>
              </button>

              <p className="text-[11px] text-[#F0F4EC]/50 text-center">
                Demo only. Contact information and backend services are not yet configured.
              </p>
            </form>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      {/* 
        ========================================================================
        FOOTER (From SHM HTML + Substance Lab 3x3 dot brand mark)
        ========================================================================
      */}
      <footer className="border-t border-white/10 bg-[#0C1208] py-14 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-xs text-[#F0F4EC]/65">
        <div className="max-w-7xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-10 mb-12">
          {/* Brand Info */}
          <div>
            <div className="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
              <div className="grid grid-cols-3 gap-1 p-1 rounded bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
                <span className="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#6DB33F]"></span>
                <span className="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/90"></span>
                <span className="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/30"></span>
                <span className="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/90"></span>
                <span className="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/30"></span>
                <span className="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/90"></span>
                <span className="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/30"></span>
                <span className="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/90"></span>
                <span className="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#6DB33F]"></span>
              </div>
              <span className="font-heading font-extrabold text-lg text-white">SHM</span>
            </div>
            <p className="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#6DB33F] font-bold mb-2">
              Restaurant • Café • Bar Excellence
            </p>
            <p className="text-xs text-[#F0F4EC]/60 leading-relaxed">
              Independent Nepal-origin hospitality performance advisory combining guest experience assessment, training, cost control, and business improvement.
            </p>
          </div>

          {/* Who We Serve */}
          <div>
            <h4 className="font-heading font-bold text-sm text-[#6DB33F] uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
              Who We Serve
            </h4>
            <div className="space-y-2.5">
              <a href="#clients" className="block hover:text-white transition-colors">
                Independent Restaurants
              </a>
              <a href="#clients" className="block hover:text-white transition-colors">
                Cafés & Bakeries
              </a>
              <a href="#clients" className="block hover:text-white transition-colors">
                Bars & Lounges
              </a>
              <a href="#clients" className="block hover:text-white transition-colors">
                Small Groups
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>

          {/* Our Services */}
          <div>
            <h4 className="font-heading font-bold text-sm text-[#6DB33F] uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
              Our Services
            </h4>
            <div className="space-y-2.5">
              <a href="#services" className="block hover:text-white transition-colors">
                SHM Assessments
              </a>
              <a href="#services" className="block hover:text-white transition-colors">
                Operations Audits
              </a>
              <a href="#academy" className="block hover:text-white transition-colors">
                SHM Academy
              </a>
              <a href="#standards" className="block hover:text-white transition-colors">
                SHM Standards
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>

          {/* Get Started */}
          <div>
            <h4 className="font-heading font-bold text-sm text-[#6DB33F] uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
              Get Started
            </h4>
            <div className="space-y-2.5">
              <a href="#about" className="block hover:text-white transition-colors">
                About Us
              </a>
              <a href="#contact" className="block hover:text-white transition-colors">
                Contact Us
              </a>
              <a href="#contact" className="block hover:text-white transition-colors">
                Request Consultation
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        {/* Legal from HTML */}
        <div className="max-w-7xl mx-auto pt-8 border-t border-white/10 text-center text-[11px] text-[#F0F4EC]/50">
          © 2026 Smart Hospitality Management (SHM). Website prototype for review. Original SHM concept; not affiliated with LQA or Forbes Travel Guide. Privacy and legal pages to be prepared before launch.
        </div>
      </footer>
    </div>
  );
}
